target macos
note libshort: a register file of fewer than 128 bytes is refused before anything is called: trap 3 (status 103).
fn p64 b edit uchar 128 o ulong v ulong to void
for i ulong 8
put b add o i uchar and shr v mul i 8 255
end
end

fn g64 b view uchar 128 o ulong to ulong
v = ulong 0
for i ulong 8
v = or v shl ulong get b add o i mul i 8
end
ret v
end

fn main to int
rg = new uchar 128 0
r = libcall ulong libfn 1 rg 0 120
ret 9
end
